# The Java edition's operator pages, by the path both editions link to an operator by:
# /<edition>/operators/<family>/#<id>. An HTTP redirect keeps the #anchor; a page that
# redirects by itself (Astro's redirects) would drop it. An older release's docs are under /vX.Y/.
/java/operators/* /concepts/operators/:splat 301
/:version/java/operators/* /:version/concepts/operators/:splat 301
